<title>GREECE: HELLENIC BOTTLING 96 PRETAX DOWN 8.4PCT TO 23.2BLN.</title>
<headline>HELLENIC BOTTLING 96 PRETAX DOWN 8.4PCT TO 23.2BLN.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's leading bottler Hellenic Bottling said in a statement that consolidated pretax profits after allowing for capital gains and minority interests fell 8.4 percent to 23.2 billion drachmas in 1996.</p>
</text>
